# Admin CMS & Lead Management Architecture Guidelines

The Admin CMS acts as the central command center for Welcome Consultancy's lead pipeline and appointment scheduling.

## 1. Lead Pipeline & Contact Priority
- **Mobile Number Emphasis**: All incoming lead tables must highlight the client's phone/mobile number as the primary actionable field, complete with one-click "Call" and "WhatsApp" triggers.
- **Lead Source Tagging**: Every lead record must be tagged by its origin:
  - Service Page Inquiry (e.g., EPCG, RoDTEP, IEC)
  - Interactive Incentive Calculator
  - EPCG Duty Estimator
  - Document Checklist Generator
  - Consultation Booking Calendar
  - Sticky WhatsApp / Exit-Intent Popup
- **Status Workflow**: Support status updates (New, Contacted, In Progress, Converted, Archived).
- **Export Capabilities**: Allow one-click CSV/Excel export of lead logs for CRM integration.

## 2. Consultation Slot Manager
- Admin panel interface to define weekly working days, start/end hours, slot interval (e.g., 30 mins), and blocked dates.
- Real-time sync with frontend consultation scheduler widget.
- View and manage upcoming booked slots with client details.

## 3. Dynamic Service & News Ticker CMS
- Modify text, document checklists, and FAQ lists for all 16 service paths without code edits.
- Publish and manage DGFT circulars, EXIM trade notifications, and homepage ticker updates.
